<!-- ============ 03 PROCESS ============ -->
<section class="chapter" id="process">
  <div class="kanji">道</div>
  <div class="clabel reveal">THE METHOD</div>
  <div class="step reveal"><div class="n">01</div>
    <div><h3>IDENTIFY THE GAP</h3><p>Build what's missing. If I have to use 3 tools to do one thing, I build the one tool.</p></div></div>
  <div class="step reveal"><div class="n">02</div>
    <div><h3>SHIP RAW, REFINE LIVE</h3><p>Everything starts as a working prototype. Polish follows function.</p></div></div>
  <div class="step reveal"><div class="n">03</div>
    <div><h3>MAKE IT FEEL ALIVE</h3><p>UI should have weight. Animations should have intention. Details matter.</p></div></div>
</section>

